From: lihuu <lihuu@example.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Add custom outbound tag support in routing settings

This patch adds the ability to specify a custom outbound tag in routing rules.
When 'custom' is selected from the outbound tag dropdown, a text input field
appears allowing users to enter their own outbound tag name.

Changes:
- Added "custom" option to outbound_tag array
- Added custom outbound tag input field in routing edit layout
- Updated RoutingEditActivity to handle custom outbound tag selection
- Added string resource for custom outbound tag label

